        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them praise thy great and terrible name;",
          "For it is holy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The king's strength also loveth judgment; Thou dost establish equity,",
          "Thou executest judgment and righteousness in Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Exalt ye the LORD our God,",
          "And worship at his footstool; For he is holy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Moses and Aaron among his priests, and Samuel among them that call upon his name;",
          "They called upon the LORD, and he answered them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spake unto them in the cloudy pillar:",
          "They kept his testimonies, and the ordinance that he gave them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou answeredst them, O LORD our God:",
          "Thou wast a God that forgavest them, though thou tookest vengeance of their inventions."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Exalt the LORD our God, and worship at his holy hill;",
          "For the LORD our God is holy."
